{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Nexen</strong>, you are trapped in a maze. Why? How? You don\u2019t know. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you are certain of is that you are being hunted. <strong>Collect orbs</strong>, <strong>complete tasks</strong> but remember: you are not alone, and <strong>it</strong> is closing in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second is a choice: <i><strong>progress or survive</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/d4be4e1e3f05df3996e17b98c5258721.avif?t=1761584442\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is always hunting. When it finds you, the only option is to run. Tense chases through twisting corridors keep your heart racing as you fight to survive and find a place to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/13d30be3657a81c456c43ea3e4eeff0a.poster.avif?t=1761584442\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/13d30be3657a81c456c43ea3e4eeff0a.webm?t=1761584442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/0b1a8e90d52ceaa598631dd86c8fb201.avif?t=1761584442\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze isn\u2019t just about survival. In <strong>task mode</strong>, complete objectives scattered throughout the maze, but remember, every second you spend focused is another second <strong>it</strong> can close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/c88d638e4eb5b62421c0f277495f023d.poster.avif?t=1761584442\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/c88d638e4eb5b62421c0f277495f023d.webm?t=1761584442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/b21974e36233789606bcbc4eeb856ff6.avif?t=1761584442\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>classic mode</strong>, collect glowing orbs and navigate the maze. Simple in theory  until you realize <strong>it</strong> is always one step behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/5cb01ca85f48d7ee2c88b20f5558cb53.poster.avif?t=1761584442\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/5cb01ca85f48d7ee2c88b20f5558cb53.webm?t=1761584442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/452f3f16485dbec8e16c6ea89510ded1.avif?t=1761584442\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze always wins. The question is: <strong>how long can you last?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/9fd1685b76c7bad83b6465bab78beec7.poster.avif?t=1761584442\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815160/extras/9fd1685b76c7bad83b6465bab78beec7.webm?t=1761584442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Orb!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815160/b745abc7250e347fff320ea00e4e5314646c5d90.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815160/359ab421fd7e8aafce9d49fe20c28b508868e647.jpg"},{"name":"Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815160/e8739b791408509610ea22d606b563411c4a54e3.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815160/cbb728ab3938502133c3c51b3bea2662563d137e.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Overlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815160/e6d66346ad931a5071e384cd0c40af3a7f901e48.jpg"},{"name":"Insert Coin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815160/6120a005dad81dc06ef1f1f75e84edac4e13c111.jpg"},{"name":"Maze Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815160/4a6f7e5ea00de9de16f093ce4fb770d412ffc96e.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost Dodger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815160/778b93dd40fa1a7d79afb9604bd3fe43015323a8.jpg"},{"name":"Arcade Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815160/3387f2f2b94f55afb6646c9735a28cc39878d695.jpg"},{"name":"Wakka Wakka Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815160/4dcd4b78a3445e1a3e25108fae541213d575affc.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/i